{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Funkels</strong>, everyone is trying to be the Funkel Lord \u2014 including you, your enemies, your former friends, and probably that weird thing you just summoned by accident. Every character plays completely differently, with their own ridiculous cards, powers, and bad habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll fight your way through a world packed with over 45 unique enemies, each with a personality and playstyle of their own. Some will crush you. Some will confuse you. Some will just be deeply, uncomfortably weird. And yes \u2014 you can play as <i>any</i> of them once you\u2019ve capture them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953500?t=1760283380","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953500?t=1760283380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953500/46d020a5d396ff3f1749a1fac38a066f1065e5b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760283380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953500/46d020a5d396ff3f1749a1fac38a066f1065e5b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760283380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4003390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Funkels</strong>, everyone is trying to be the Funkel Lord \u2014 including you, your enemies, your former friends, and probably that weird thing you just summoned by accident. Every character plays completely differently, with their own ridiculous cards, powers, and bad habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll fight your way through a world packed with over 45 unique enemies, each with a personality and playstyle of their own. Some will crush you. Some will confuse you. Some will just be deeply, uncomfortably weird.